@meyerovb, Airbyte has Facebook app with v17, and these fields ([listed in error message](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte/issues/35334#issue-2137438403)) are predefined for insights report.
To bypass this limitation I'd recommend you to create custom insight report and select there only available/required fields.
![image](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte/assets/36314070/35b88d37-551a-4f20-aa62-7bdf6f546965)

@mehdigati ,

I selected these fields just as an example.
Did you left only custom_insight stream enabled in your connection?
